</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Cost of revenue (excluding
impairment loss) for workspace membership primarily consists of (1) lease expenses, (2) employee compensation and benefits, (3) depreciation
and amortization expenses, and (4) other workspace operating costs, such as costs for daily maintenance and cleaning, and insurance costs.</p><div>

