<td style="width: 24px; text-align: left">(3)</td><td style="text-align: justify">Ms. Yan Xu ceased to be our financial reporting director
                                            since June 30, 2025.</td>
</tr></table><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.75in; text-indent: -0.75in">&#160;</p><div>

