of the Company&#8217;s VIEs and VIEs&#8217; subsidiaries after the elimination of inter-company transactions and balances as of December&#160;31,
2024 and 2025 and for the&#160;years ended December&#160;31, 2023, 2024 and 2025 was included in the accompanying consolidated financial
statements:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

