    <td colspan="2" style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; font-weight: bold; text-align: center">As of <br/> December&#160;31,<br/> 2025</td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; font-weight: bold">&#160;</td></tr>
