<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="uk_ScheduleOfDiscontinuedOperationsFromCashFlowsTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="uk:ScheduleOfDiscontinuedOperationsFromCashFlowsTableTextBlock" id="ixv-31340"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The condensed cash flows of
interior design and construction business were as follows for the year ended December 31, 2023 and for the period from January 1, 2024
to October 26, 2024 are included in the consolidated statements of cash flows of the Group as cash flow from discontinued operation:&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

