</div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="us-gaap:AccountsAndNontradeReceivableTextBlock" id="ixv-31907"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in"><b>6. ACCOUNTS
RECEIVABLE, NET</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

