<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">As of December 31, 2024 and
2025, all accounts receivable was due from third party customers. Provision for credit losses for the years ended December 31, 2023, 2024
and 2025 were RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c8" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProvisionForOtherCreditLosses" scale="3" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-39348">9,778</ix:nonFraction>, RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c9" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProvisionForOtherCreditLosses" scale="3" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-39349">1,112</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProvisionForOtherCreditLosses" scale="3" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-39350">274</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. There is no recovery collected for the year ended December 31, 2023, 2024 and
2025.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_OtherCurrentAssetsTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="us-gaap:OtherCurrentAssetsTextBlock" id="ixv-32068"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in"><b>7. PREPAID EXPENSES
AND OTHER CURRENT ASSETS, NET</b></p>

