<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Provision for credit losses
for prepayment and other current assets for the year ended December 31, 2023 was RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c32" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OtherAssetsCurrent" scale="3" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-39381">6,293</ix:nonFraction>, and reversal for credit losses for prepayment
and other current assets for the year ended December 31, 2024 and 2025 were RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c9" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableAllowanceForCreditLossesRecovery" scale="3" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-39382">4,824</ix:nonFraction> and RMB <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableAllowanceForCreditLossesRecovery" scale="3" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-39383">1,942</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. There is <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c32" decimals="-3" format="ixt:fixed-zero" name="uk:FinancingReceivableAllowanceForCreditLossesNoRecovery" scale="3" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-39384"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c4" decimals="-3" format="ixt:fixed-zero" name="uk:FinancingReceivableAllowanceForCreditLossesNoRecovery" scale="3" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-39385"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c5" decimals="-3" format="ixt:fixed-zero" name="uk:FinancingReceivableAllowanceForCreditLossesNoRecovery" scale="3" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-39386">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> recovery
collected for the year ended December 31, 2023, 2024 and 2025.</p></ix:continuation><div>

