<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The Group adopted Monte Carlo
model using a Longstaff Schwartz algorithm to assess the forward sale contract&#8217;s fair value. The valuation involves complex and
subjective judgements as well as the Group&#8217;s best estimates on the valuation date. Key inputs related to the model for the valuation
of the fair value of the forward sale contract are as follows:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

