<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The aggregate intrinsic value
was calculated as the difference between the exercise price of the underlying awards and the closing stock price of US$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c306" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="uk:ClosingStockPrice" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-39883">0.63</ix:nonFraction> of the Company&#8217;s
ordinary share on December&#160;31, 2025.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

