<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">As of December&#160;31, 2025,
there was no unrecognized compensation cost related to unvested share options.</p></ix:continuation><div>

