EVENTS</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The Group has evaluated the
impact of events that have occurred subsequent to December 31, 2025, through the issuance date of the consolidated financial statements,
other than the subsequent event described above, the Group did not identify any subsequent events that would have required adjustment
or disclosure on the consolidated financial statements.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

